                  <rules>
                    <rule id="7d72-982a-891e-a351" name="Heavy Transport" hidden="false">
                      <description>Add enough transports to carry the entire formation. Land Raiders carry 2 Tactical-sized units or 1 Terminator, Spartans twice that and Mastodons four times (Dreadnoughts count as Terminators); the count is set from the formation.</description>
